#: of readme_rosetta.markdown_handler.MarkdownHandler.protect_code_blocks:1
msgid "Replaces code blocks with placeholders to prevent translation."
msgstr ""
"**Replacing Code Blocks with Placeholders**\n"
"\n"
"You can use the following code to replace code blocks with placeholders in your Markdown text:\n"
"\n"
"```markdown\n"
"~~~\n"
"{{ placeholdeer_code_block }}\n"
"~~~\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"For example, if you want to replace the following code block:\n"
"\n"
"```python\n"
"print(\"Hello World!\")\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"With a placeholder, you would use the following:\n"
"\n"
"~~~\n"
"{{ placeholdeer_code_block }}\n"
"~~~\n"
"\n"
"You can then add your own text or code in place of the placeholder."

