#~ msgstr ""
#~ "# README Rosetta CLI Module \n"
#~ "\n"
#~ "# About This Module\n"
#~ "This module provides a command-line interface for interacting with the Rosetta API. It offers a simple and intuitive way to send translations requests, manage projects, and track the status of your translations.\n"
#~ "\n"
#~ "## Installation\n"
#~ "To use this module, you will need to have Python installed on your system. You can install it via pip:\n"
#~ "\n"
#~ "```bash\n"
#~ "pip install rosetta\n"
#~ "```\n"
#~ "\n"
#~ "## Usage\n"
#~ "You can view more information about this module by running the following command:\n"
#~ "\n"
#~ "```bash\n"
#~ "rosetta --help\n"
#~ "```\n"
#~ "\n"
#~ "For a full list of commands and options, please refer to the Rosetta documentation.\n"
#~ "\n"
#~ "## API Documentation\n"
#~ "\n"
#~ "To get started with the Rosetta API, you will need to register for an account and obtain an API key. For more information on how to do this, please visit our website:\n"
#~ "\n"
#~ "```bash\n"
#~ "https://rosetta-api.org/\n"
#~ "```\n"
#~ "\n"
#~ "You can find a list of available commands and options in the `--help` output.\n"
#~ "\n"
#~ "## Contributing\n"
#~ "\n"
#~ "If you're interested in contributing to this project, we welcome pull requests from qualified developers. Please see our contribution guidelines for more information.\n"
#~ "\n"
#~ "```bash"

